{"name": "StoneHold MOBA", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/514dbbbc9dd477532dc3cbb6ccda8c1b.poster.avif?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/514dbbbc9dd477532dc3cbb6ccda8c1b.webm?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/a401f3b64ef62e4652ef4d8952780140.poster.avif?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/a401f3b64ef62e4652ef4d8952780140.webm?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/a401f3b64ef62e4652ef4d8952780140.mp4?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Jump into 20-minute matches with over-the-shoulder action. Dodge, aim, and outplay enemy Wardens with precise timing, smart positioning, and skillful ability chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/28895c88c96375faaa4c3c546a553950.webp?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/4fe73c56243c020c060b6bfebebadf18.poster.avif?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/4fe73c56243c020c060b6bfebebadf18.webm?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/4670187e7fd0afa8b8859027e2969e48.poster.avif?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/4670187e7fd0afa8b8859027e2969e48.webm?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/4670187e7fd0afa8b8859027e2969e48.mp4?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Warden-specific, 30-card skill decks to fit your team. Draw cards by destroying turrets and leveling up, then play them mid-fight to adapt on the fly. No two battles \u2014 or builds \u2014 ever play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/28895c88c96375faaa4c3c546a553950.webp?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/fa35b6268086862de39c045ce564bc6e.poster.avif?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/fa35b6268086862de39c045ce564bc6e.webm?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/f84020d269d29e533bd6c431bc3eaca8.poster.avif?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/f84020d269d29e533bd6c431bc3eaca8.webm?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/f84020d269d29e533bd6c431bc3eaca8.mp4?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Win matches and events to earn unique rewards. Salvage duplicates into Shards to upgrade your favorites, unlocking stronger effects balanced by mana and cooldown trade-off. Tune your deck with a mix of quick, low-cost bursts and heavy-hitting, high impact attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/28895c88c96375faaa4c3c546a553950.webp?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/6ea7d51351108dc325725496e04ffc1d.poster.avif?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/6ea7d51351108dc325725496e04ffc1d.webm?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/4004190f9f20e02acda55fe75f9552ee.poster.avif?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/4004190f9f20e02acda55fe75f9552ee.webm?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/4004190f9f20e02acda55fe75f9552ee.mp4?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive into regular drops that keep the battlefield alive: new Wardens, fresh card sets, balance changes, and seasonal events that keep the meta moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/28895c88c96375faaa4c3c546a553950.webp?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/661a2225f3f4dc0421f2a672c322c361.poster.avif?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/661a2225f3f4dc0421f2a672c322c361.webm?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/c20a3231537efed982825c0d63e774dc.poster.avif?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/c20a3231537efed982825c0d63e774dc.webm?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/c20a3231537efed982825c0d63e774dc.mp4?t=1772718377\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a unique fantasy realm carved from stone and magic in Unreal Engine 5. Command Wardens inspired by iconic RPG classes \u2014 Barbarian, Ranger, Wizard, and more \u2014 each with stylized visuals and rich lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/extras/28895c88c96375faaa4c3c546a553950.webp?t=1772718377\" width=\"960\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "StoneHold is a free-to-play 5v5 action MOBA where collectible card strategy meets intense third-person combat. Pick a Warden, build a deck, draw by crushing turrets and defeating enemies, then swap cards and skills at base for constant counterplay. UE5 visuals and a world of chiseled stone magic.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1615760/9b66cf9d993e9fd27622f5ea7f3f0979b69cb727/header.jpg?t=1772718377", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "RPG", "MOBA", "Deckbuilding", "Card Battler", "Tactical RPG"], "developers": "Little Orbit", "publishers": "Little Orbit", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1615760", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "26 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/oP3RmzM8x5A", "first_seen": 1772060400.0, "review_rank": 1084}